{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YBllorEvse1795423060.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市先跌後回升。</p><p></p><p>四大指數中，深圳創業板指數升幅較大，升百分之3。滬深京三市成交，逾1.5萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>算力硬件、機械人和貴金屬板塊上升。銀行和保險股則下跌。</p><p></p><p>內地證券交易所將在本月30日起降低「孖展」比例，由百分之100降至百分之80，以提升市場流動性。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.264385+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T12:37:13.510700+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:15.214143+00:00","content_hash":"fd4fa35da5b218416d029e2e88e2c5c507be53f03aaccf7e1118431a8d882632","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.264385+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}